|               |                             Filter: sum(store_sales.ss_ext_list_price - store_sales.ss_ext_wholesale_cost - store_sales.ss_ext_discount_amt + store_sales.ss_ext_sales_price / Int64(2)) > Decimal128(0.000000,24,6)                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 |
